## Factor Miner Cycle Summary (miner_1, 2026-07-16)

### Explored Factors
- **`rev5x_er_soft` — 5d reversal × soft efficiency-ratio weight.** Motivation: prior cycles established short-horizon mean-reversion dominance on this 15-name cross-asset panel, but a bare 5d reversal is noisy in trending regimes. Construction: `-(close_t/close_{t-5} − 1) × max(0, 1 − ER20_t)` where ER20 is the 20-day efficiency ratio (net move / path length). Reversal signals are upweighted in choppy (low-ER) regimes and downweighted in clean trends.
- **Artifact alignment fix (this cycle's blocking issue).** The prior `.npy` artifact was on the trading-day grid (1582 rows) while the library uses the BTC calendar (2388 rows, 2020-01-01..2026-07-15). Rebuilt the signal aligned to the standard calendar before any admission computation.

