1 
2 Context:
3 - Library (14 distinct effective factors) is dominated by 1-5d mean-reversion
4   signals (rev_1d/2d/3d, nclv_1d..5d, id_rev, nbody, cz_rev1, rev1_pk,
5   rev1_x_inveff, rev_1d_vs) plus mom_10d_skip5 (used negatively = reversal).
6 - Previous miner3 candidates got evicted by the post-Miner gate because pooled
7   rho vs miner2_20260716_mom_10d_skip5 exceeded 0.5 (often ~0.88 due to
8   shared short-horizon return structure).
9 - This cycle tests genuinely different families: long-horizon reversal,
10   volatility asymmetry/tail, trend structure, cross-asset beta (BTC/US10Y/XAU/
11   WTI), overnight/intraday share, volume-conditioned, and robust RSI-2.
12 
13 Gate: |IC1| >= 0.007, |ICIR1| >= 0.084 (1d forward rank IC on
14 2021-01-04..2026-07-15), max_abs_library_correlation < 0.5 (pooled spearman
15 on the full panel grid).
